https://mizjeannie.com/formulary/sachet-for-clearing-a-room-after-an-upsetting-encounter&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait reference card with a black background, muted-pink botanical borders and headings, and readable cream text matching the approved recipe and cautions. A woodland window, candle, dried herbs, bowl, measuring spoon, and cotton sachet decorate the scene. The gold watermark at bottom right matches the supplied reference emblem." height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6aef78fa7e5e5.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 19:16:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>哈马精彩瞬间</title><link>https://some.pics/6aef5407d4eac</link><description>&lt;p&gt;300……哈马！ #11freunde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A red magazine titled "11 FREUNDE 300" with the subtitle "Eine Liebeserklärung an den Fußball" (A declaration of love for football) is on a wooden surface. A circular badge on the magazine reads "LOVE FOOTBALL, HATE FASCISM!". - Ein rotes Magazin mit dem Titel "11 FREUNDE 300" und dem Untertitel "Eine Liebeserklärung an den Fußball" liegt auf einer Holzoberfläche. Ein kreisförmiges Abzeichen auf dem Magazin lautet "LOVE FOOTBALL, HATE FASCISM!".' height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6aef5407d4eac.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 16:38:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>快乐的狗在葡萄园</title><link>https://some.pics/6aef3053871e6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;葡萄园里的一只快乐小狗&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Een blije hond aan een wijngaard" height="3648" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/pdhlh/6aef3053871e6.jpg" width="5472"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://pdhlh.some.pics"&gt;@pdhlh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 14:06:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11月7日黑色烟晶接骨木</title><link>https://some.pics/6aef0616d1c7e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日对应 — 2026年11月7日&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;黑色 · 烟晶 · 接骨木&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 7, 2026. Color: Black — protection, banishing, boundaries, clearing. Crystal: Smoky Quartz — grounding, clearing, protection, release. Herb: Elder (Sambucus nigra) — protection, thresholds, healing, ancestor-work. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6aef0616d1c7e.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 11:06:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>冷遇湿</title><link>https://some.pics/6aef0341b9489</link><description>&lt;p&gt;...当寒冷遇上潮湿...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Brown meadow grass, dotted with frost crystals. Even the threads of the spider’s web between the flower heads are white with frost. The background is blurred, tinged with that characteristic hue of the morning light shining through the dissipating mist. " height="3698" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aef0341b9489.jpg" width="2642"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 10:53:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>叶芝诗与酒店水瓶</title><link>https://some.pics/6aeee64fdc6e1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;酒店免费提供的瓶装水让我开心极了。

叶芝是我最喜欢的诗人之一。

背景中的这首诗就是这首。

https://poets.org/poem/living-beauty&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A 500 ml bottle of water with a picture of Yeats on the front and a poem of his in blue on the background " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6aeee64fdc6e1.jpg" width="2268"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:50:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>圣克鲁兹Jack's Burgers探店</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee8de110a74</link><description>&lt;p&gt;探索圣克鲁兹。

📍 杰克汉堡店，加利福尼亚州圣克鲁兹&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A restaurant pick up window with the chef framed in the opening " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmj/6aee8de110a74.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmj.some.pics"&gt;@jmj&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:33:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巫术中的感恩练习</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee74d93bfb9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在你的巫术实践中，也有感恩的空间。你可以点燃一支蜡烛，说出别人对你的善举。花时间回想他们所做的，能帮你找到感谢他们的话语。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-and-rose storybook scene of a witch writing a note at a candlelit wooden desk beside a sleeping cat. Ivy and pink curtains frame a round window showing an airborne postal boat carrying envelopes above a moonlit hillside village. Warm ivory lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: There's room for gratitude in your witchcraft. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6aee74d93bfb9.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 00:46:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《亡者之舞》后读《夜之盛宴》</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee40960e354</link><description>&lt;p&gt;读完了《什么让死者移动》，所以自然而然地我开始读《什么在夜晚进食》了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Photo of the book "What Feasts At Night", by T. Kingfisher' height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/swrogers/6aee40960e354.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://swrogers.some.pics"&gt;@swrogers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:03:21 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>